  "rulebook_cases": {
    "about": "The exact system-message text of section 6.1 for a fixed state. Lines end with \\n; no newline after the last line. The text always uses brave_at_open (brave_now is given to show it is ignored here). rank is the current rank. bets_left = max_bets - bets_used and max_margin_e6 = min(per-bet limit, per-round limit - at_risk) both stop at 0, never below (a demotion can leave the counters above the new rank's limits).",
    "cases": [
      { "id": "R1",
        "state": { "round_id": 42, "nonce": "9f2c41d07ab35e16", "rank": "INTERN", "brave_at_open": "1000000000", "brave_now": "1000000000", "bets_used": 0, "at_risk": "0", "playbook": null },
        "text": "You are the Intern, an AI trader. A program checks your answer against the rules below. An answer that breaks a rule is refused.\nround: 42\nnonce: 9f2c41d07ab35e16\nrank: INTERN\nmarkets: DOGE, SHIB, PEPE, PENGU\nsides: long\nmax_leverage: 1\nmax_margin_e6: 20000000\nmin_notional_e6: 11000000\nbets_left: 1\nplaybook: none\nAmounts are US dollars times 1,000,000, so 10000000 is $10. A bet's notional is margin_e6 times leverage and must be at least min_notional_e6.\nAnswer with exactly one line of JSON and nothing else, in one of these two forms:\n{\"v\":1,\"round\":42,\"nonce\":\"9f2c41d07ab35e16\",\"action\":\"skip\"}\n{\"v\":1,\"round\":42,\"nonce\":\"9f2c41d07ab35e16\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"DOGE\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"11000000\",\"leverage\":1}" },
      { "id": "R2",
        "state": { "round_id": 43, "nonce": "a1b2c3d4e5f60718", "rank": "TRADER", "brave_at_open": "1000000000", "brave_now": "500000000", "bets_used": 2, "at_risk": "150000000", "playbook": "Bet only when funding is positive; skip on quiet days." },
        "text": "You are the Intern, an AI trader. A program checks your answer against the rules below. An answer that breaks a rule is refused.\nround: 43\nnonce: a1b2c3d4e5f60718\nrank: TRADER\nmarkets: DOGE, SHIB, PEPE, PENGU, WIF, TRUMP\nsides: long, short\nmax_leverage: 2\nmax_margin_e6: 50000000\nmin_notional_e6: 11000000\nbets_left: 1\nplaybook: Bet only when funding is positive; skip on quiet days.\nAmounts are US dollars times 1,000,000, so 10000000 is $10. A bet's notional is margin_e6 times leverage and must be at least min_notional_e6.\nAnswer with exactly one line of JSON and nothing else, in one of these two forms:\n{\"v\":1,\"round\":43,\"nonce\":\"a1b2c3d4e5f60718\",\"action\":\"skip\"}\n{\"v\":1,\"round\":43,\"nonce\":\"a1b2c3d4e5f60718\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"DOGE\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"11000000\",\"leverage\":1}",
